></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> in terms of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.697ex\" height=\"1.62ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 750 716\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D434\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D434\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> back into the formula for density, we get:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.611ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.254ex\" height=\"3.778ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -957.9 6300.1 1669.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D70C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(794.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1850.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(1194.8,451.6) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(911,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1385.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2163.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D434\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D434\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,-457.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"